{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The skies burn as an alien fleet unleashes relentless warships, promising annihilation. Facing our darkest hour, only one dares to stand against the tide. Take control  in this pixelated 2D arcade-style space shoot-'em-up, and become the savior our home planet desperately needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience classic arcade action with a modern touch:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Orbital Siege</strong> blends elements of planetary defense with the arcade shooting of Asteroids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense Shoot-'em-up Gameplay:</strong> Face waves of unique alien enemies and boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Your Ship:</strong> Collect power-ups to enhance your firepower, speed, and defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dodge and Weave:</strong> Skillfully maneuver through dense enemy fire using precise controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixelated Retro Aesthetic:</strong> Enjoy vibrant pixel art that pays homage to the golden age of arcade gaming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556690/extras/Orbital_Siege.gif?t=1748189606\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556690?t=1748189606","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556690?t=1748189606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556690/790886393cbe11ee7272d7ec60c28501930d5b13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748189606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556690/790886393cbe11ee7272d7ec60c28501930d5b13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748189606","categories":[{"description